{# v2ex integration report section (spec v2ex §9).

Renders one tab's selected posts:
- H2: tab name, linked to the tab page
- H3 per post: title as a link to the original topic
- a small badge line: node · author · replies · score
- the AI takeaway as the main paragraph
- the AI reason ("why selected") inside a collapsed <details>

HTML escaping rules (security critical):
- title / url / author / node are external data → MUST be HTML-escaped with ``| e``
- reason / takeaway are trusted AI output → rendered verbatim (already
  downgrade-headings-sanitised by the tracker)

Posts within a section are separated by ``---``; sections themselves are
joined and footed once by the aggregator (``aggregated_v2ex.j2``).
#}
## [V2EX {{ tab_title }}]({{ tab_url | e }})

{% for post in posts %}
### [{{ post.title | e }}]({{ post.url | e }})
<small>🏷️ {{ post.node | e }} · 👤 {{ post.author | e }} · 💬 {{ post.replies }} · ⭐ {{ post.score }}</small>

{{ post.takeaway }}

<details>
<summary>{{ _("Why selected") }}</summary>

{{ post.reason }}
</details>
{% if not loop.last %}

---

{% endif %}
{% endfor %}
